ming irritation. The perfect skin revitalizing cream for sensitive skin. This cream contains capsules containing madecassoside and a This daily cream has a fresh finish without any stickiness. * Niacinamide: Evening Skin Tone & Anti-inflammatory ingredient * Tranexamic Acid: Brightening ingredient that helps to reduce dark spots * Alpha-Bisabolol: Soothing & healing ingredients * No Artificial fragrance / No Artificial colorant: Zero use of artificial fragrance and colorants that can cause skin irritation * Care-Free Use of Skin Irritation Tested Products * Care-free use for sensitive skin type * Skin irritation test implemented for enabling all skin type KEY INGREDIENTS: Tranexamic Acid: Brightens dark spots. Niacinamide: Tones skin and evens skin tone. HOW TO USE: After cleansing, apply an appropriate amount to skin and rub gently in to absorb. [Product capacity] 75g [option] tone brightening capsule cream #K-beauty #KOKSARA #skin1004 —————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————— ♡Three Promises of koksara.kbeauty 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.√ 2.We sell 100% genuine.√ 3.Chatable time: All the time [24/7].√', 212.5, 104.2, NULL, 'Beauty > Skincare > Facial Moisturizer', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134207-82633-mm6rxffaqkg2d0', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F23324388312', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
