ormativo de marca e modelo do anúncio. NÚMERO INTERNO: * 057903', 145.05, 145.05, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Spare Parts for Automobiles > Electrical System', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134201-7r98o-m2wo3h18u8sz0d', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1350808941%2F23598040678', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
