Living > Furniture > Wardrobes', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7req4-m8x80nzk9a5e5c', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F872473112%2F22593925630', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
